                  "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
                  "size": 260065
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "langs": [
            "en"
          ],
          "text": "More and more of the ice cream was melting. It dripped down on Toad\u2019s jacket. It splattered on his pants and on his feet. \n\n\u201cWhere is the path?\u201d cried Toad. \u201cI cannot see!\u201d"
